type: txt
help: Proxy entry cache Time-To-Live (default: 30000)
val_help: u32:10000-120000; Time in milliseconds
syntax:expression: exec "${vyos_libexec_dir}/validate-value  --exec \"${vyos_validators_dir}/numeric --range 10000-120000\"  --value \'$VAR(@)\'"; "TTL must be between 10000 and 120000 milliseconds"
